   "en": "Samurai Musou ~Sengoku Saikyou no Samurai, Isekai o Seiku~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "Unrivaled Samurai ~ The Strongest Samurai of the Sengoku Era Conquers Another World ~"
